{
  "statement": "The sustainability of the autonomous driving system is crucial for reducing its environmental impact. My requirements focus on minimizing energy consumption (GRN-01), utilizing renewable energy sources (GRN-02), and ensuring lifecycle assessments of all components (GRN-03). Furthermore, we aim for efficient energy recovery during braking (GRN-04), monitoring carbon emissions (GRN-05), and optimizing routing for energy efficiency (GRN-06). The emergency protocols (GRN-07) are essential to minimize energy use during failures. However, I raise concerns regarding EFF-01 and EFF-04, as their focus on speed and responsiveness may compromise energy efficiency and sustainability.",
